/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (Monte\040Carlo\040climate\040change\040forecasts\040with\040a\040global\040coupled\040ocean\055atmosphere\040model)
/Author (Ulrich\040Cubasch\054\040Benjamin\040D\056\040Santer\054\040A\056\040Hellbach\054\040Gabriele\040C\056\040Hegerl\054\040Heinke\040Höck\054\040Ernst\040Maier\055Reimer\054\040Uwe\040Mikolajewicz\054\040Achim\040Stössel\054\040Reinhard\040Voss)
/Subject (Four\040time\055dependent\040greenhouse\040warming\040experiments\040were\040performed\040with\040the\040same\040global\040coupled\040atmosphere\055ocean\040model\054\040but\040with\040each\040simulation\040using\040initial\040conditions\040from\040different\040\215snapshots\216\040of\040the\040control\040run\040climate\056\040The\040radiative\040forcing\040\204\040the\040increase\040in\040equivalent\040CO2\040concentrations\040from\0401985\2052035\040specified\040in\040the\040Intergovernmental\040Panel\040on\040Climate\040Change\040\050IPCC\051\040scenario\040A\040\204\040was\040identical\040in\040all\040four\04050\055year\040integrations\056\040This\040approach\040to\040climate\040change\040experiments\040is\040called\040the\040Monte\040Carlo\040technique\040and\040is\040analogous\040to\040a\040similar\040experimental\040set\055up\040used\040in\040the\040field\040of\040extended\040range\040weather\040forecasting\056\040Despite\040the\040limitation\040of\040a\040very\040small\040sample\040size\054\040this\040approach\040enables\040the\040estimation\040of\040both\040a\040mean\040response\040and\040the\040\215between\055experiment\216\040variability\054\040information\040which\040is\040not\040available\040from\040a\040single\040integration\056\040The\040use\040of\040multiple\040realizations\040provides\040insights\040into\040the\040stability\040of\040the\040response\054\040both\040spatially\054\040seasonally\040and\040in\040terms\040of\040different\040climate\040variables\056\040The\040results\040indicate\040that\040the\040time\040evolution\040of\040the\040global\040mean\040warming\040signal\040is\040strongly\040dependent\040on\040the\040initial\040state\040of\040the\040climate\040system\056\040While\040the\040individual\040members\040of\040the\040ensemble\040show\040considerable\040variation\040in\040the\040pattern\040and\040amplitude\040of\040near\055surface\040temperature\040change\040after\04050\040years\054\040the\040ensemble\040mean\040climate\040change\040pattern\040closely\040resembles\040that\040obtained\040in\040a\040100\055year\040integration\040performed\040with\040the\040same\040model\056\040In\040global\040mean\040terms\054\040the\040climate\040change\040signals\040for\040near\040surface\040temperature\054\040the\040hydrological\040cycle\040and\040sea\040level\040significantly\040exceed\040the\040variability\040among\040the\040members\040of\040the\040ensemble\056\040Due\040to\040the\040high\040internal\040variability\040of\040the\040modelled\040climate\040system\054\040the\040estimated\040detection\040time\040of\040the\040global\040mean\040temperature\040change\040signal\040is\040uncertain\040by\040at\040least\040one\040decade\056\040While\040the\040ensemble\040mean\040surface\040temperature\040and\040sea\040level\040fields\040show\040regionally\040significant\040responses\040to\040greenhouse\055gas\040forcing\054\040it\040is\040not\040possible\040to\040identify\040a\040significant\040response\040in\040the\040precipitation\040and\040soil\040moisture\040fields\054\040variables\040which\040are\040spatially\040noisy\040and\040characterized\040by\040large\040variability\040between\040the\040individual\040integrations\056)
